WEBVTT

00:14.514 --> 00:16.599
You have come so far.

00:17.183 --> 00:18.852
You can do it.

00:19.269 --> 00:21.020
Be it today

00:21.354 --> 00:22.814
or the days ahead.

00:23.022 --> 00:24.899
No matter how tough it gets,

00:26.818 --> 00:30.655
I'll never give up!

02:11.214 --> 02:14.008
Where are you, Tanjiro?

02:15.176 --> 02:17.512
This uncomfortable sound keeps ringing.

02:18.054 --> 02:19.931
Please be safe, Tanjiro.

02:20.723 --> 02:22.642
Hey, Mr. Zenitsu.

02:22.725 --> 02:25.812
Are we running in circles?

02:26.062 --> 02:29.232
I know, right? That's what I thought too!

02:29.315 --> 02:30.567
You're good, Shoichi.

02:30.650 --> 02:31.985
You're so reliable.

02:32.193 --> 02:35.029
Can you go and check that room?

02:37.073 --> 02:40.410
What? I know. Don't look at me like that!

02:40.493 --> 02:42.704
I'll check it out myself.

02:48.877 --> 02:50.211
It's empty.

02:51.838 --> 02:53.172
Let's walk this way then.

02:54.382 --> 02:58.595
Tanjiro, come out now.

03:00.889 --> 03:03.933
The room actually rotated!

03:25.371 --> 03:26.706
I can do this.

03:27.123 --> 03:28.374
I can definitely do this.

03:29.000 --> 03:30.543
I'm a guy who can complete my mission.

03:33.171 --> 03:36.007
I don't care if I break my bones.

03:36.341 --> 03:37.634
I can do this.

03:38.134 --> 03:39.177
I can fight.

03:47.018 --> 03:50.563
I'll let you see that I'm still amazing
even with a bone fracture.

04:01.282 --> 04:02.325
This is bad.

04:02.408 --> 04:04.369
Nothing has changed.

04:04.827 --> 04:06.996
Raising my spirits alone
won't change anything.

04:07.497 --> 04:08.581
Think.

04:08.665 --> 04:10.792
I need to raise my spirits
and think simultaneously.

04:13.419 --> 04:15.380
Think.

04:20.802 --> 04:21.844
That was close.

04:22.136 --> 04:23.846
That was really close just now.

04:24.347 --> 04:25.473
Damn it.

04:25.556 --> 04:26.849
You're so annoying.

04:27.100 --> 04:30.228
I want to eat the rare blood now.

04:35.483 --> 04:37.318
I don't have time to think at all.

04:40.446 --> 04:42.156
What's your name?

04:44.325 --> 04:45.576
Kyogai.

04:46.577 --> 04:47.704
Kyogai.

04:48.079 --> 04:49.122
Kiyoshi...

04:49.664 --> 04:51.124
I won't surrender the rare blood.

04:51.541 --> 04:52.834
I won't lose hope.

04:53.376 --> 04:54.460
I won't give up!

04:58.131 --> 05:00.049
You should give up.

05:01.467 --> 05:05.179
If I can get my hands on the rare blood,

05:05.471 --> 05:07.849
I can return to Twelve Demon Moons.

05:20.528 --> 05:23.281
You should give up.

05:26.326 --> 05:28.786
How boring.

05:35.084 --> 05:39.047
What you wrote is so boring.

05:40.590 --> 05:44.052
All these papers are as good as trash.

05:45.344 --> 05:49.140
Not wonderful, not dreamy,
and not jaw-dropping.

05:49.724 --> 05:52.810
You shouldn't write again.

05:53.144 --> 05:56.397
If you write,
you'll only waste paper and ink.

05:57.273 --> 06:01.069
You don't leave the house
during the daytime recently.

06:01.527 --> 06:05.114
That's exactly why
you've become so boring.

06:05.782 --> 06:08.826
Otherwise, you can play the drums for fun

06:09.202 --> 06:11.037
since you're stuck in the house.

06:12.121 --> 06:13.748
Come to think of it,

06:13.956 --> 06:17.251
your drumming skill isn't good enough
for you to teach others too.

06:49.367 --> 06:52.120
Disappear, you filthy bugs!

06:52.495 --> 06:54.956
Rapid Drumming!

06:55.206 --> 06:58.167
Can he beat the drums at a quicker pace?

07:15.643 --> 07:17.019
I'm getting so dizzy.

07:17.186 --> 07:19.772
This speed of rotation is bad.

07:19.939 --> 07:21.441
What a spectacular move.

07:23.943 --> 07:27.655
The number of claws increased
from three to five.

07:39.709 --> 07:40.835
I get it now.

07:45.339 --> 07:47.758
Thank goodness, I purposely avoided
from stepping on the papers.

07:47.925 --> 07:52.013
I know the way to move and breathe
without hurting my body.

07:53.931 --> 07:55.933
I need to breathe lightly and quickly.

07:57.643 --> 07:59.020
Through this way of breathing,

07:59.228 --> 08:02.064
it will strengthen the muscles
surrounding my fractured leg.

08:02.648 --> 08:05.526
Before the claw attacks,

08:05.943 --> 08:07.778
there's a rotten smell.

08:09.489 --> 08:11.449
The claw attacks are coming.

08:14.535 --> 08:15.578
Above.

08:16.162 --> 08:17.121
Left.

08:17.330 --> 08:18.289
Right.

08:18.414 --> 08:19.373
Behind.

08:20.708 --> 08:23.085
He dodged all my attacks.

08:26.881 --> 08:28.257
Total Concentration Breathing.

08:28.341 --> 08:29.675
Breath of Water.

08:38.392 --> 08:39.435
Ninth Form.

08:39.852 --> 08:41.604
Splashing Water Flow Turbulent.

08:42.688 --> 08:46.150
When I land, the landing area
must be as small as possible.

08:46.484 --> 08:48.861
He can handle the rotation of this room.

08:49.153 --> 08:50.863
Go. Rush inside.

08:50.988 --> 08:52.490
Get within attack range.

08:52.657 --> 08:53.783
Move forward.

08:53.950 --> 08:55.826
Go in front of him.

08:58.621 --> 09:00.581
I see the opening thread.

09:01.082 --> 09:02.041
Kyogai!

09:02.375 --> 09:04.627
Your Blood Demon Art is really amazing.

09:25.898 --> 09:27.900
It hurts!

09:28.150 --> 09:30.945
I accidentally took a deep breath.

09:33.406 --> 09:36.993
I'm the eldest son.

09:38.202 --> 09:39.620
Brat.

09:41.914 --> 09:43.499
Answer me.

09:45.918 --> 09:51.424
Is my Blood Demon Art really amazing?

09:54.260 --> 09:57.013
It's really amazing, but...

10:00.433 --> 10:02.643
killing humans is unforgivable.

10:06.647 --> 10:08.441
I see.

10:11.027 --> 10:13.279
Right, I need to take his blood sample.

10:26.000 --> 10:27.460
I got his blood.

10:27.835 --> 10:31.088
After it pierces through,
it will extract the blood automatically.

10:31.797 --> 10:33.174
I can't believe it worked.

10:33.341 --> 10:35.092
Yushiro's skill is so impressive.

10:39.347 --> 10:40.431
A cat?

10:41.891 --> 10:44.852
You're going to help me
deliver this to Ms. Tamayo, right?

10:45.728 --> 10:47.772
You're the best. Thank you.

10:51.192 --> 10:52.401
It's done.

10:52.610 --> 10:54.111
Okay, be careful on the road.

11:01.202 --> 11:02.787
I heard it's Yushiro's spell.

11:02.870 --> 11:04.955
Nobody can see the cat
before the meow sound.

11:05.081 --> 11:08.334
After we hear the meow again,
it'll disappear.

11:08.918 --> 11:10.294
So it's true.

11:13.255 --> 11:16.300
I need to go find the other kids.

11:22.181 --> 11:26.143
My writings.

11:28.396 --> 11:32.400
What you wrote is so boring.

11:33.359 --> 11:36.779
All these papers are as good as trash.

11:38.280 --> 11:42.034
Not wonderful, not dreamy,
and not jaw-dropping.

11:45.246 --> 11:47.206
They aren't trash.

11:48.874 --> 11:52.336
At least to that brat,

11:52.420 --> 11:55.965
they are not something to be stepped on.

11:57.258 --> 11:58.968
Rest in peace.

12:07.476 --> 12:12.731
My Blood Demon Art and drumming

12:14.942 --> 12:17.027
are recognized.

12:19.989 --> 12:22.450
Kiyoshi! Teruko!

12:23.117 --> 12:25.536
Kiyoshi! Teruko!

12:26.996 --> 12:28.622
Kiyoshi! Teruko!

12:35.796 --> 12:37.173
Mr. Tanjiro.

12:37.923 --> 12:40.342
Why did you throw things at me?

12:40.593 --> 12:41.802
I'm sorry.

12:41.886 --> 12:44.013
The drumming stopped so we were confused.

12:45.723 --> 12:46.724
I see.

12:47.057 --> 12:49.185
But thank goodness, you guys are okay.

12:55.232 --> 12:56.734
You did your best.

12:57.443 --> 12:58.569
Kiyoshi too.

12:59.987 --> 13:02.031
All right, let's go outside.

13:02.781 --> 13:04.241
Come up. I'll piggyback you.

13:06.660 --> 13:08.245
Is your leg okay?

13:08.412 --> 13:09.413
Yes.

13:09.705 --> 13:11.540
Hang in there, just for a little longer.

13:13.042 --> 13:15.211
I can smell Zenitsu and Shoichi.

13:16.337 --> 13:17.630
They went out.

13:18.297 --> 13:19.423
Both of them are okay.

13:20.633 --> 13:21.800
It's the smell of blood.

13:22.760 --> 13:24.011
What's wrong?

13:24.261 --> 13:26.055
Nothing. Let's hurry.

13:37.024 --> 13:39.235
Scat!

13:39.652 --> 13:41.529
Draw your sword and fight.

13:41.695 --> 13:43.656
You coward!

13:50.329 --> 13:51.539
Tanjiro.

13:53.374 --> 13:56.126
I protected your box

13:57.419 --> 14:00.297
because you said it before

14:00.631 --> 14:03.676
that this is more important

14:05.594 --> 14:06.971
than your life.

14:14.103 --> 14:15.187
I...

14:16.272 --> 14:18.649
I have always had good ears.

14:21.026 --> 14:26.073
I can hear people talking
when I'm asleep sometimes.

14:27.032 --> 14:28.701
It terrifies me.

14:31.662 --> 14:33.664
The demon's voice vanished.

14:34.707 --> 14:35.791
Tanjiro.

14:36.000 --> 14:37.626
You defeated the demon, didn't you?

14:38.752 --> 14:40.296
Other than Tanjiro and the others,

14:40.462 --> 14:44.383
there's a set
of weird and noisy footsteps.

14:46.218 --> 14:48.596
Mr. Zenitsu!

14:49.638 --> 14:51.098
Mr. Zenitsu!

14:55.269 --> 14:56.478
Thank goodness.

14:56.645 --> 14:58.063
Are you okay?

14:59.523 --> 15:01.609
When the room rotated,

15:01.775 --> 15:03.652
we were flung out with full force

15:04.111 --> 15:06.196
and fell from the third floor.

15:09.283 --> 15:10.618
Is that so?

15:11.535 --> 15:16.040
You protected me, so I wasn't injured.

15:16.749 --> 15:18.042
That's great.

15:18.834 --> 15:21.795
But why are you crying your eyes out?

15:27.384 --> 15:28.886
I understand now!

15:28.969 --> 15:31.055
I hit my head on the ground!

15:31.138 --> 15:32.139
Yes.

15:32.222 --> 15:33.474
Am I going to die?

15:33.557 --> 15:34.767
Am I dying?

15:36.060 --> 15:38.938
I think I'm feeling dizzy.

15:40.189 --> 15:42.191
What's that?

15:42.483 --> 15:46.779
Rushing in like a boar!

15:48.197 --> 15:49.990
It appeared again!

15:50.074 --> 15:52.451
Monster boar!

15:54.787 --> 15:56.789
I smell a demon.

15:57.623 --> 15:58.707
That guy.

15:58.791 --> 16:00.834
I only realized after hearing his voice.

16:01.043 --> 16:02.836
He's the fifth survivor.

16:03.087 --> 16:04.922
During the Final Selection,

16:05.089 --> 16:07.174
he was the earliest to go up the mountain.

16:07.299 --> 16:09.468
He also went down the mountain earliest.

16:09.677 --> 16:11.136
What an impatient guy!

16:15.975 --> 16:18.435
I found you.

16:20.062 --> 16:21.522
Stop it!

16:24.316 --> 16:25.567
What?

16:25.651 --> 16:26.819
What are you doing?

16:27.152 --> 16:28.696
Scat now!

16:28.946 --> 16:31.115
I'm Zenitsu Agatsuma.

16:31.323 --> 16:33.867
Like you, I'm also a member
of Demon Slayer Corps.

16:35.494 --> 16:36.954
Demon Slayer Corps?

16:37.079 --> 16:38.706
You should know this then.

16:38.914 --> 16:41.250
That thing must be disposed of.

16:41.709 --> 16:43.627
Hurry now, get out of the way.

16:43.711 --> 16:44.795
I won't!

16:45.045 --> 16:47.881
-This belongs to Tanjiro.
-Don't dillydally!

16:48.465 --> 16:52.219
Otherwise, I'll dispose of you
together with the box.

16:52.636 --> 16:54.847
Get out of the way!

16:57.474 --> 16:59.018
Damn you.

17:00.019 --> 17:01.520
This box...

17:02.187 --> 17:05.232
I won't let you touch this box.

17:05.315 --> 17:07.443
It's Tanjiro's most precious thing.

17:08.235 --> 17:11.321
Hey, what are you saying?

17:11.613 --> 17:13.824
There's a demon inside this box.

17:13.991 --> 17:15.451
Don't you know that?

17:15.743 --> 17:18.370
I knew that right from the start!

17:20.706 --> 17:23.000
I know he has been carrying a demon

17:24.209 --> 17:27.713
because a human's sound
is totally different from a demon's.

17:29.089 --> 17:30.090
But

17:30.758 --> 17:35.262
from Tanjiro, I heard a gentle voice
that can make anyone cry.

17:36.638 --> 17:40.350
It's a gentle voice
I have never heard before.

17:42.603 --> 17:45.939
Every living thing will make sounds.

17:46.732 --> 17:49.443
They will make many sounds.

17:50.736 --> 17:51.904
Breathing sounds.

17:51.987 --> 17:53.072
Heartbeat sounds.

17:53.280 --> 17:54.740
Blood flow sounds.

17:55.741 --> 17:57.659
If I focus on hearing those sounds,

17:57.993 --> 18:00.621
I can hear their inner thoughts.

18:02.206 --> 18:05.084
But I'm always deceived.

18:06.126 --> 18:10.672
I only believe someone
I want to believe in.

18:12.716 --> 18:16.428
As a member of Demon Slayer Corps,
Tanjiro carried a demon to work.

18:17.346 --> 18:21.350
But he must have his own reason.

18:21.892 --> 18:26.146
I believe it's a reason I can accept.

18:27.523 --> 18:28.607
I...

18:30.776 --> 18:34.613
I want to ask Tanjiro myself.

18:35.155 --> 18:38.700
So, you should move aside!

18:47.626 --> 18:49.294
Let go of me!

18:51.296 --> 18:52.589
Aren't you tired of this?

18:58.137 --> 19:00.013
I won't let you touch that box.

19:02.766 --> 19:06.645
That's Tanjiro's most precious thing.

19:09.481 --> 19:12.609
Before he comes back,
I won't let you touch it!

19:13.026 --> 19:14.361
Damn you.

19:21.368 --> 19:22.536
Scat!

19:23.162 --> 19:24.496
I won't!

19:31.962 --> 19:34.089
Scat!

19:34.506 --> 19:36.466
Draw your sword and fight.

19:36.592 --> 19:38.552
You coward!

19:45.225 --> 19:46.476
Tanjiro.

19:48.395 --> 19:51.064
I protected your box

19:52.316 --> 19:55.152
because you said it before

19:55.652 --> 19:58.655
that this is more important

20:00.407 --> 20:01.867
than your life.

20:03.660 --> 20:06.163
You sure are good at talking.

20:06.246 --> 20:08.749
Why don't you draw your sword?

20:09.166 --> 20:12.961
Since you're also from Demon Slayer Corps,
let's have a duel.

20:19.384 --> 20:22.679
If you don't want to fight,
get out of the way now!

20:22.888 --> 20:23.931
Move it!

20:29.603 --> 20:30.729
Scat!

20:39.988 --> 20:41.365
Whatever.

20:42.032 --> 20:45.118
If you won't get out of the way,

20:45.786 --> 20:49.539
I'll pierce you and the box together.

20:54.795 --> 20:55.796
Stop it!

21:02.844 --> 21:07.349
Stop it!

22:51.369 --> 22:53.914
Making the room rotate then attack.

22:53.997 --> 22:55.582
What an impressive Blood Demon Art.

22:56.541 --> 23:00.712
The more the demons resemble Kibutsuji,
the more powerful their Blood Demon Arts.

23:00.796 --> 23:02.756
Can I really defeat them?

23:04.007 --> 23:06.259
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:06.426 --> 23:08.261
The demon, Kyogai,
who lives inside the courtyard.

23:08.345 --> 23:09.888
I heard he loves
Legend of the Eight Samurai.

23:09.971 --> 23:12.599
He also wrote his own legendary stories.

23:14.101 --> 23:15.811
Now isn't the time to be discouraged.

23:15.936 --> 23:18.980
Next, episode 14, "The House
with the Wisteria Family Crest."

23:19.064 --> 23:20.607
I'll do my best!

23:20.690 --> 23:21.817
It hurts so much!

23:21.900 --> 23:23.777
I forgot I still have a bone fracture.

23:24.986 --> 23:26.029
TO BE CONTINUED

23:26.113 --> 23:27.489
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
